# Mudang in the white jangsam robe and peaked gokkal hat with paper flowers,
# a red gasa sash over the shoulder: the costume for the cleansing rite
# (ssitgim-gut) and for calling a drowned soul out of the water. Long sleeves
# hang from the cuffs. pole holds the bamboo spirit pole forward, cloth holds
# the long white cloth at the waist. Side view, faces right, 32x40.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 32 40
@output ../characters/npc_mudang_white.png
@preview ../previews/npc_mudang_white_x4.png 4
@columns 6

